	!! Deliberately no misc entry here. The base games clothing totals
	!! gosub has no branch for a misc category at all - the real array is
	!! misc_outfits, holding exactly one scripted item, not a shop stock
	!! with a real count. A misc entry here previously called totals with
	!! a key that gosub does not recognize, so total stayed at whatever
	!! the prior category in this list left it at, granting that many
	!! phantom items into a misc array with no image or description
	!! support anywhere in the game - shown in the wardrobe as blank rows.
	glqs_cc_total = glqs_cc_n
	killvar 'glqs_cc_n'
